1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,037
How to Network Without Feeling Fake.

2
00:00:02,987 --> 00:00:08,262
Genuine networking is about building relationships, not collecting contacts.

3
00:00:08,262 --> 00:00:11,287
The best networkers give more than they take.

4
00:00:11,287 --> 00:00:16,412
They share knowledge, make introductions, and offer help without keeping score.

5
00:00:16,412 --> 00:00:20,225
Starting with people already known is an effective approach.

6
00:00:20,225 --> 00:00:25,712
Curiosity about others’ work and what they find meaningful builds authentic connections.

7
00:00:25,712 --> 00:00:31,387
A thoughtful follow-up message after a conversation is more valuable than a stack of business cards.

8
00:00:31,387 --> 00:00:36,100
Authentic connections develop over time, not from a single interaction.

